OL,3,GNEWSAFerries cancelled and disrupted as
OL,4,Astrong gales and rain hit Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a dozen ferry routes have
OL,7,Fbeen cancelled for the rest of the day
OL,8,Fas strong gales and heavy rain hit
OL,9,FScotland.
OL,11,FA Met Office yellow warning covers
OL,12,Fparts of the Highlands and Western
OL,13,FIsles until 19:00 with the risk of
OL,14,Fgusts touching 70mph (113km/h) in
OL,15,Fplaces.
OL,17,FHeavy rain is also expected across
OL,18,FScotland as the remnants of Hurricane
OL,19,FIsais hit parts of the UK.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
